window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I'm her new boss, and I'm taking what was supposed to be mine. </p> <p><b>Caleb</b> </p> <p>The intern and I have a history. It's tarnished and complicated. Filthy and forbidden. </p> <p>Yet she walked away a virgin. </p> <p>Then my buddy hires her to do a secret task for our firm. </p> <p>I'm her new boss. </p> <p>Now she can't say no. She's going to give me what's mine. </p> <p>Author's note: <i>The Billionaire and the Virgin Intern</i> is a stand-alone romance with a guaranteed HEA ending and no cliff-hanger. Trigger warning: Contains graphic scenes that may be disturbing to some listeners. Each story in the Seduction and Sin Series can be listened to in any order. </p>"; 
